# The Walls of Your Mind (bastok 69): 287 with hide 0 and option 2. Accepted by GM with the guide alone (no knuckles, no map: the
# player dropped the knuckles): 287 with hide 0, option 0 (nothing); the map by GM: 287 with hide 1, option 2 deletes the
# quest (available again), the guide and the map. Then skill 0: not offered, the default 230.
lists PortBastok/Oggbi/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/287
char zone=PortBastok pos=-159,-7,5 job=MNK lvl=75
quest Bastok.GhostsOfThePast completed    # MNK AF1 (Oggbi's 231) out of the way
quest Bastok.TheFirstMeeting completed    # MNK AF2 (Oggbi's 233) out of the way
quest Bastok.TheWallsOfYourMind accepted
keyitem WeaponTrainingGuide
login
trigger Oggbi                    # accepted, no Annals, no knuckles, no map: 287 with hide 0
finish option=0                # option 0: nothing
keyitem MapToTheAnnalsOfTruth
trigger Oggbi                    # the map: 287 with hide 1
finish option=2                # the quest deleted, the guide and the map deleted
trigger Oggbi                    # available, skill 0: not offered, 230
finish
